                                "sense_id": "d33cf809-55f3-35ad-8e63-9fdd10f6f119",
                                "text": "This spreading warmth, so freely shed, / Is token that ye are not dead, / Nor tranced beneath the hard, brute heel / Whose hoofish tread yet leaves you leal / To all the thoughts that gather round […]"
